<title>INDIA: Indian crude petroleum output falls in August.</title>
<headline>Indian crude petroleum output falls in August.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's crude petroleum production fell to 2.60 million tonnes in August from 3.00 million in the same month last year, the government said.</p>
<p>    PETROLEUM OUTPUT     Aug 96    Aug 95	  Apr-Aug</p>
<p>							   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Crude		    2,631     2,983    13,281     14,816</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products   5,604     4,849    25,984     24,218</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary. Figures for petroleum products relate to throughput.</p>
</text>
